		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(550, 20, 300, 180)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">Train ImageNet starts when both inputs arrive (5 epochs, about 10 seconds). Classify Images shows the accuracy on the test images; the Data Table lists every Prediction next to its category; Misclassified Images shows the confusion matrix; Inspect ImageNet shows the filters. The dataset paths are absolute.</text>
